# cron entry
# Copy the line below into `crontab -e`, adjusting the path and schedule for your deployment.
#
#   *    *    *    *    *  command to be executed
#   ┬    ┬    ┬    ┬    ┬
#   │    │    │    │    └───── day of week (0-7)
#   │    │    │    └────────── month (1-12)
#   │    │    └─────────────── day of month (1-31)
#   │    └──────────────────── hour (0-23)
#   └───────────────────────── minute (0-59)

*/2 * * * * cd /path/to/project-dir && venv/bin/python main.py >> /var/log/project-id.log 2>&1
